<title>UKRAINE: SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT ARMENIA 7-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT ARMENIA 7-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine beat Armenia 7-0 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in their European under-21 soccer championship group nine</p>
<p>qualifying match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Olexander Kosyrin 2, 23, 55, Andriy Golovko 77, 88,</p>
<p>Artem Onyshchenko 78, Denys Sautin 79</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L   F  A  Pts</p>
<p> Germany		4  4  0  0   9  1   12</p>
<p> Ukraine		5  3  0  2  11  3    9</p>
<p> Portugal	     5  3  0  2  10  8    9</p>
<p> Albania		4  1  0  3   5 13    3</p>
<p> Armenia		4  0  0  4   5 15    0</p>
<p>Next matches: June 6  Portugal v Albania, Ukraine v Germany</p>
</text>
